OL,3,ADad and son remain critical after
OL,4,Amasked men attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son are in hospital in a
OL,7,Flife-threatening condition after an
OL,8,Fattack in their family home which
OL,9,Fappeared "completely unprovoked",
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,13,Fdisturbance at a house in Station Road,
OL,14,FThurnby, shortly before 00:30 BST on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Police said a man in his
OL,18,F50s was stabbed multiple times, while a
OL,19,Fboy, 15, was also stabbed by two masked
OL,20,Fmen who entered the property. The force
OL,21,Fgave an update on Friday to say both
OL,22,Fremained critical in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
