OL,3,ADad and son remain critical after
OL,4,Amasked men attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers added that the man's wife -
OL,7,Fwho is in her 40s - suffered minor
OL,8,Finjuries to her hand and shoulder
OL,9,Fduring the attack. Three other children
OL,10,Fwho were in the address were not
OL,11,Finjured.
